Z||000011||Dan86gt3.8||02-04-2000||10:02 PM||||Hey man I saw that movie the other night I think it was on, wednesday night.  And yes all theese otheres are right its a "turbo interceptor" by chrystler.  And according to Charlie Sheen its the only one in existance.  Alsoo if you look close you can see the chrystler logo on the nose (right about where the fiero's is).  And I was also curious so I watched all the credits and at the end they give props to chrystler for donating "the turbo interceptor".  Just my .02, but hey I thought it was a fiero kit too but then I started noticing the eblem on the front, and watched the credits.  but I read an article in one of the kit cars that was talking about kits in movies, you rember that bad ace ferrari nick Cage tears up on the streets of san fran in the rick, well you guessed it it was a fiero kit!||||reg||12
