Z||000013||superXmotorsports||02-05-2000||04:41 PM||||These new versions are being built 15 miles from my place.  The only Fiero part that is being used in the final product is the cockpit.  It has a tube frame and a mid-engine Northstar w/ Corvette axles/brakes.  They are going to produce a 'turbo-interceptor' model w/ a twin-turbo northstar 550hp.  The first run should be finished by late-spring and I'll post some pics.  It will cool to know that one of my defunct Fieros is inside of an awesome $60,000 specialty car.  The owners of the company 'US EXOTICS' are really great guys too and like Fieros as they are also!  SXM.<BR>||||reg||1
